89	      // the shape of the conditions, and `legacy-task-fields` is what says so. What
90	      // is checked here is a STATED one: the value, and the one pairing that cannot
91	      // work. A `schedule` task whose expression reads the ITEM has nothing to be
92	      // judged against at a tick — the scheduler's own ask carries no item — so the
